<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo-bkn.png"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css"/>
  <style>
    @page {
      size: A4 portrait;
      margin: 15mm 20mm;
    }
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #0f172a;
      padding: 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .no-print-bar {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif;
    }
    .btn-action {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: #2563eb; color: #fff; }
    .btn-secondary { background: #e2e8f0; color: #334155; }

    .doc-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 800px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      padding: 40px 50px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    .kop-surat {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 3px double #0f172a;
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .kop-logo {
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
      object-fit: contain;
      margin-right: 20px;
    }
    .kop-text {
      text-align: center;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .kop-text h2 {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .kop-text h1 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #1e3a8a;
      margin: 2px 0;
    }
    .kop-text p {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .doc-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .doc-title h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-decoration: underline;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .doc-title p {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-family: monospace;
    }

    .doc-section {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      text-align: justify;
    }
    .meta-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 12px 0 18px 0;
      font-size: 13.5px;
    }
    .meta-table td {
      padding: 6px 4px;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .meta-label {
      width: 220px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .rincian-box {
      border: 1px solid #0f172a;
      background: #fbfcfe;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }
    .rincian-box table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 13.5px;
    }
    .rincian-box td {
      padding: 6px 0;
    }
    .border-top-black {
      border-top: 1px solid #0f172a;
    }

    .signature-grid {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-top: 36px;
      font-size: 13px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .sig-col {
      width: 240px;
    }
    .sig-space {
      height: 70px;
    }
    .sig-name {
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media print {
      body { background: #fff; padding: 0; }
      .no-print-bar { display: none !important; }
      .doc-container { border: none; box-shadow: none; padding: 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="no-print-bar">
    <button onclick="window.history.back()" class="btn-action btn-secondary">
      <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Kembali
    </button>
    <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn-action btn-primary">
      <i class="bi bi-printer"></i> Cetak Bukti Pencairan
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="doc-container">
    <div class="kop-surat">
      <img src="/images/logo-bkn.png" alt="Logo BKN" class="kop-logo"/>
      <div class="kop-text">
        <h2>Badan Kepegawaian Negara &mdash; Kantor Regional V Jakarta</h2>
        <h1>Koperasi Pegawai Kanreg V BKN</h1>
        <p>Jl. Raya Ciracas No. 36, Ciracas, Jakarta Timur 13740 &bull; Telp: (021) 87721079 &bull; Email: koperasi@kanreg5bkn.id</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-title">
      <h3>Bukti Pencairan Pembiayaan Pinjaman Anggota</h3>
      <p>Nomor: BP-PJ/<%= String(pinjaman.id).padStart(5, '0') %>/<%= new Date(pinjaman.tanggal_persetujuan || pinjaman.created_at).getFullYear() %></p>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-section">
      Pada hari ini, <strong><%= new Date(pinjaman.tanggal_persetujuan || pinjaman.created_at).toLocaleDateString('id-ID', {weekday:'long', day:'numeric', month:'long', year:'numeric'}) %></strong>, telah dilakukan realisasi pencairan dana pinjaman Koperasi Pegawai BKN Kanreg V Jakarta kepada anggota dengan rincian identitas sebagai berikut:
    </div>

    <table class="meta-table">
      <tr>
        <td class="meta-label">Nama Anggota Pegawai</td>
        <td width="15">:</td>
        <td><strong><%= pinjaman.nama %></strong></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="meta-label">NIP</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><code><%= pinjaman.nip %></code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="meta-label">Unit Kerja</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><%= pinjaman.unit_kerja || 'Kantor Regional V BKN Jakarta' %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="meta-label">Jabatan</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><%= pinjaman.jabatan || 'Pegawai' %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="meta-label">Keperluan Pinjaman</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><%= pinjaman.keperluan || 'Kebutuhan Pribadi Pegawai' %></td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="doc-section" style="font-weight:bold;">
      Rincian Transaksi Pembiayaan Pinjaman:
    </div>

    <div class="rincian-box">
      <table>
        <tr>
          <td>Plafon Pinjaman Disetujui</td>
          <td width="20" align="center">:</td>
          <td align="right"><strong>Rp <%= Number(pinjaman.nominal_pengajuan).toLocaleString('id-ID') %>,-</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Premi Pinjaman / Administrasi (1%)</td>
          <td width="20" align="center">:</td>
          <td align="right" style="color:#b91c1c;">( - ) Rp <%= Number(pinjaman.biaya_admin || 0).toLocaleString('id-ID') %>,-</td>
        </tr>
        <% if (pinjaman.is_topup && pinjaman.pelunasan_pinjaman_lama > 0) { %>
        <tr>
          <td>Pelunasan Sisa Pokok Pinjaman Lama</td>
          <td width="20" align="center">:</td>
          <td align="right" style="color:#b91c1c;">( - ) Rp <%= Number(pinjaman.pelunasan_pinjaman_lama).toLocaleString('id-ID') %>,-</td>
        </tr>
        <% } %>
        <tr class="border-top-black" style="font-weight:bold; font-size:15px;">
          <td>Total Dana Bersih Dicairkan (Diterima)</td>
          <td align="center">:</td>
          <td align="right" style="color:#047857;">Rp <%= Number(pinjaman.nominal_cair || (pinjaman.nominal_pengajuan - (pinjaman.biaya_admin||0))).toLocaleString('id-ID') %>,-</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td colspan="3" style="padding-top:10px; font-style:italic; font-size:12.5px;">
            Terbilang: <strong># <%= terbilang %> #</strong>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td colspan="3" style="padding-top:8px; font-size:12.5px; border-top:1px dotted #cbd5e1;">
            Tenor Angsuran: <strong><%= pinjaman.tenor_bulan %> Bulan</strong> &bull; Suku Bunga: <strong><%= pinjaman.suku_bunga_persen %>% / bulan (Sliding Rate)</strong> &bull; Metode: <strong>Potong Gaji (Payroll)</strong>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-section">
      Penerima pinjaman menyetujui seluruh ketentuan dan bersedia dipotong gajinya setiap bulan melalui payroll sampai dengan pinjaman dinyatakan lunas oleh Koperasi BKN Kanreg V Jakarta.
    </div>

    <div class="signature-grid">
      <div class="sig-col">
        <p>Yang Menerima Dana Pinjaman,</p>
        <p>Anggota Pegawai</p>
        <div class="sig-space"></div>
        <p class="sig-name"><%= pinjaman.nama %></p>
        <p>NIP. <%= pinjaman.nip %></p>
      </div>

      <div class="sig-col">
        <p>Jakarta, <%= new Date(pinjaman.tanggal_persetujuan || pinjaman.created_at).toLocaleDateString('id-ID', {day:'numeric', month:'long', year:'numeric'}) %></p>
        <p>Bendahara / Kasir Koperasi BKN,</p>
        <div class="sig-space"></div>
        <p class="sig-name"><%= pinjaman.catatan_admin ? 'Pengurus Koperasi' : 'Bendahara Koperasi' %></p>
        <p>Koperasi Pegawai Kanreg V BKN</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
